    <data key="d0">DAZN Key Moments Video Processing Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Push-based video overlay synchronization architecture using Fargate, Rekognition, Lambda, Kinesis Analytics, ECS, and DynamoDB.</data>
